  id: 
  abilityName: Breakneck Rush
  description: '- Effect: Nikita rushes in a straight line toward an enemy, striking
    them upon reaching an adjacent tile. If the attack hits, she gains a temporary
    Speed boost.

    - Explanation: Nikita uses her athletic ability to close distances
    and pressure opponents. This ability provides mobility and damage in one action,
    making it useful for reaching enemies across the battlefield.'
